OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council pauses plan
OL,4,Ato fire and rehire 23,000 staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council has agreed to
OL,7,Fpause plans to fire and rehire more
OL,8,Fthan 23,000 members of staff.
OL,10,FThe decision follows online talks
OL,11,Fbetween the council and three trade
OL,12,Funions, chaired by Deputy First
OL,13,FMinister Jenny Gilruth.
OL,15,FNegotiations between the council and
OL,16,Fthe GMB, Unison and Unite unions will
OL,17,Fresume early next week to try to reach
OL,18,Fa new deal on pay.
OL,20,FLetters which had been due to be sent
OL,21,Fto staff informing them of the fire and
OL,22,Frehire plans will not be issued.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
